<title>USA: Evergreen Resources holds Falkland stake.</title>
<headline>Evergreen Resources holds Falkland stake.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evergreen Resources Inc said Tuesday it held a two percent working interest in a corsortium that was awarded an exploration licence for Tranche A in the First Offshore Falkland Islands Offshore Licensing Round.</p>
<p>The award, made to a group headed by Amerada Hess Corp, was announced in London October 28 by the Falkland Islands government.</p>
<p>The licence covers 1,621 square kilometers and lies about 250 kilometers to the north of the South Atlantic archipelago.</p>
<p>Argos Evergreen Ltd is a 5 percent working interest holder in the consortium. It is a venture formed in the Falkland Islands and owned 60% by Argos Resources Ltd and 40 percent by Evergreen Resources. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
